    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SOFYA: Why are we slowing down?\nSOFYA: We're stopping. Why are we stopping?\nSASHA: I don't know, mother. No idea.\nSOFYA: Excuse me, why has the train stopped?",
      "SOFYA: This is unbearable. No wonder I feel lonely. I'm surrounded by morrons.\nSASHA: Mama, you're being ridiculous.\nSOFYA: Am I? I sit here and listen to this talk of love and God and equality, knowing full well that Count Generosity here is fully prepared to giv…",
      "SASHA: Mama, please...\nSOFYA: Now...",
      "SASHA: Honestly, I have no idea.\nSOFYA: DON'T PLAY GAMES WITH ME.",
      "SOFYA: Lyovochka!\nSOFYA: Please forgive me, my darling!\nSASHA: Mother...\nSOFYA: I'm a fool.. I'm a selfish woman. But I love you. Please believe me. Please understand me. Please forgive me for all my weakness and badness…"
    ]
  },
